XferCore 1.6.4
==============

Release Note
------------

Release Date: 2026-08-30

Changes:
- Version bump to 1.6.4
- Fixed uTP connection_id scheme to comply with BEP 29 / libtorrent.
  The initiator/responder send/recv ids were swapped, so uTP handshakes
  with standard clients could never complete and always fell back to TCP.
- Added SYN-retransmit routing and a standalone uTP protocol self-test
- General improvements and bug fixes

---

